<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Verify your email</title>
</head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <h1 style="color: #3A8F5C;">Welcome to Ritora, {{firstName}}!</h1>
  <p>Please verify your email address by clicking the button below:</p>
  <p style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
    <a href="{{verificationUrl}}" style="background-color: #3A8F5C; color: #ffffff; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; display: inline-block;">Verify Email</a>
  </p>
  <p>Or copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
  <p style="word-break: break-all; color: #666;">{{verificationUrl}}</p>
  <p>This link expires in 24 hours.</p>
  <hr style="border: none; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin: 30px 0;">
  <p style="color: #999; font-size: 12px;">If you did not create a Ritora account, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
</body>
</html>
